  "steps": [
    "求极限 \\(\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{2x} - 1}{x}\\)。",
    "对分子和分母分别求导，得到 \\(\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{2e^{2x}}{1}\\)。",
    "代入 \\(x = 0\\)：\\(\\frac{2e^0}{1} = 2 \\cdot 1 = 2\\)。",
    "因此 \\(\\lim_{x \\to 0} \\frac{e^{2x} - 1}{x} = 2\\)。",
    "取 \\(x = 0.001\\) 验算：\\(\\frac{e^{0.002} - 1}{0.001} \\approx 2.002\\)，与 \\(2\\) 吻合。"
  ],
